# ==============================================================================
# D365 Finance & Operations — Source Repository
# Zero Build VM / Hosted Agent CI-CD Architecture
# ==============================================================================
# Strategy: block everything at root with /*, then whitelist only what is
# source of truth. Nothing generated by the X++ compiler, MSBuild, or IDE
# is ever committed.
# ==============================================================================

# ── 1. Block everything at root ──────────────────────────────────────────────
/*

# ── 2. Root files to track ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!azure-pipelines.yml
!publish-artifact-d365fo.tools.ps1
!nuget.config
!packages.config
!README.md
!nuget.exe
!nuget-push-artifacts-cmd.md
!Prepare-D365FoTools-Vendor.ps1
!azure-release-lcs-pipeline.yml

# ── 3. Root configuration / documentation folders ───────────────────────────
# NOTE: .claude/ was missing from this list until 2026-09-18. Because section 1
# blocks everything at root with /*, that meant the entire Claude Code setup --
# CLAUDE.md, .mcp.json, and all 56 skills, the richest and only banner-free copy
# of the skill corpus -- was silently untracked. A fresh `git clone` produced a
# repo with no Claude configuration at all. Do not remove these entries.
!.github/
!.agents/
!.codex/
!.vscode/
!.claude/
!docs/
!tools/
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!PROVENANCE.md
!.mcp.json

# Per-developer Claude Code state stays local: machine-specific permission grants,
# session scratch, and anything the CLI writes for this checkout only.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/projects/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/todos/

# ── 4. Build pipeline folder ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tracks : SandboxBuild.sln, *.rnrproj  (nuget.config + packages.config live at root)
# Ignores: restored NuGet packages, .vs/, bin/, obj/ inside SandboxBuild/
!Build/
Build/artifacts/
Build/SandboxBuild/.vs/
Build/SandboxBuild/**/bin/
Build/SandboxBuild/**/obj/
VSProjects/**/bin/
VSProjects/**/obj/

# ── 5. Model / ISV source + C# helper projects ───────────────────────────────
# All D365FO models have been moved into Metadata/  (AOS PackagesLocalDirectory
# layout). VSProjects stays at root (C# helpers, not X++ models).
!Metadata/
!VSProjects/

# ── 6. Compiler & MSBuild output (generated, never hand-edited) ──────────────
# XppMetadata : built from X++ XML by the compiler; rebuilt every pipeline run.
# bin/        : compiled DLL / PDB / XML binaries output.
# obj/        : MSBuild intermediate files.
# AdditionalFiles/: generated by the build process, not source of truth.
Metadata/**/XppMetadata/
Metadata/**/Reports/
Metadata/**/bin/
Metadata/**/obj/
Metadata/**/Resources/*.delete
Metadata/**/Resources/*.dll
Metadata/**/Resources/**/*.dll
Metadata/**/Resources/**/*.resources.dll
Metadata/**/BPCheck.xml

# AmicisLifestyle is a binary-only ISV package — its bin/ IS the deliverable
# (no X++ source exists); un-ignore it so the DLLs are committed.
!Metadata/AmicisLifestyle/bin/

# ── 7. Per-build XML logs and cross-reference files ─────────────────────────
# Emitted next to the model root on every build; not source of truth.
BuildModelResult.xml
BuildModelResult.err.xml
BuildProjectResult.xml
BuildProjectResult.err.xml
CompileLabels.xml
*.xref

# ── 8. IDE / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.rsuser
*.sln.docstates
*.log
~$*
*.db
*.VC.db
*.pidb
*.delete
*.rnrproj.bak
*- [Bb]ackup.rdl
*- [Bb]ackup ([0-9]).rdl
*- [Bb]ackup ([0-9][0-9]).rdl
*.rdl.data
*.rdl
!docs/**/*.rdl
#docs/**/*.docx
docs/fabric-paginated/out/
.agents/skills/**/__pycache__/

.vscode/d365fo-sync-index.json
